": "BC-TGT-VR-Assets-Screenshot-3.png", "id": "2292782377859066", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827799_2292782381192399_1340486148683666533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JK4-gDVPe_cQ7kNvwGp-4NG&_nc_oc=AdlMt6T0CrbjtKkV0jeB_zACjZB7Kj32rhnQxQZ71yWA33iiZZ6ZxqwQD5JB1epO4d4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw75U8ZYVbFDHOVEbQhelYPElviKkfuKo0N0oK0CREtpw&oe=69AC12A1"}, {"file_name": "BC-TGT-VR-Assets-Screenshot-1.png", "id": "1316023630187577", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623555_1316023633520910_969384270837556882_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fccS8cAfWJQQ7kNvwEylwXZ&_nc_oc=AdkC-HJstGOJwbsUPsmf1HzC65qb1HYLCcAkoVFOmg55UM4e7FbDTPqVbubPVeelZDo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxBFUEzf_kHi1NIQNeuw7olSAHv1TmsJfxe6kIZgPGn5Q&oe=69AC0409"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_2560x1440_04.png", "id": "24601797839508616", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303903_24601797849508615_5317927419449763142_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lY8YoxgEaUMQ7kNvwGLzIKb&_nc_oc=Adn06iIFQjmH4o7KSOXL4DjE_yeSDHRO_HGtqe4yQCyfo7StQQSlCPHUJp37rjIQ4gU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzXUt-2ksoHz-GFpGcfIt-Kb5siXEwsAu1Uggl03Y06EA&oe=69AC357A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BC-TGT-VR-Assets-Trailer-Cover-Image.png", "id": "1948389922405269", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618251_1948389929071935_2806373752474007181_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6BQgQbmwsCgQ7kNvwEt9Ssr&_nc_oc=AdlxumcHYkhC-9KSnSaTRbNYL1NAmSbqtlGEFXDN45XPwzV34YVPidFgw4ILK2wtZ3g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxrgOnznL7Sq5qiAwTLpbx6DqpSg1aL9V1v_ALqgHjPNg&oe=69AC0B9B"}, "display_name": "The Golden Thread", "keywords": ["Meditation", "Spiritual", "Mindfulness", "Musical"], "long_description": "The Golden Thread is an immersive VR musical experience that invites participants on a poetic and contemplative journey of self-discovery, inner alignment, and cosmic connection. Set to the high-frequency harmonies of Beautiful Chorus, the experience unfolds across ethereal landscapes \u2013 gardens, starscapes, and celestial cloud realms \u2013 each reflecting a different stage of transformation and awareness.\n\nGuided by luminous beings of light and elemental energy, participants follow a metaphysical golden thread \u2013 a symbol of intuition and inner guidance \u2013 through three phases: connection to nature, expansion into limitless potential, and arrival into a space of safety, love, and belonging. Each movement is inspired by a song and theme: Dear Moon (energy), Star (possibility), and Goodnight Moonchild (protection).\n\nDesigned as a meditative and emotional journey rather than a traditional narrative, It offers a soulful portal for viewers to reconnect with their essence and feel held within the greater fabric of existence.\n", "short_description": "An immersive VR musical journey with Beautiful Chorus. Travel through realms of light, nature, and cosmos to awaken presence, intuition, and belonging."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://iwanttoexperience.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://iwanttoexperience.com/terms", "publisher_name": "https://iwanttoexperience.com/", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.beautifulchorus.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "suppor